        <li><a href="/guides/maine-dispensary-packaging">Maine Dispensary Packaging Requirements</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="disclaimer">
      <p><strong>Legal and safety information, not advice.</strong> This page summarizes public authorities reviewed on July 21, 2026. Product formulation, facility, testing, labeling, and packaging requirements depend on the facts. Confirm current requirements with OCP and qualified counsel before manufacturing or selling an edible.</p>
    </section>

